---
description: Scope guard — Loot Drop is the only polished scene this phase
alwaysApply: true
---

- All polish effort goes into the Loot Drop round. Do not rebuild or
  beautify the other six Treasure Trap rounds in this phase.
- Do not polish menus/lobby beyond functional-and-on-theme while the core
  scene still has open weaknesses (tracked in `docs/VISUAL_SELF_REVIEW.md`).
- The required playable loop is: create room -> friend joins -> host starts ->
  both see the animated scene -> allocate loot -> lock in -> synced reveal ->
  scores update -> next question. Changes must keep this loop intact.
- Loot Drop gameplay rules: 4 answer islands, 100 loot per player split in
  steps of 10, lock-in commits, correct island pays 2x, loot on wrong islands
  is plundered. Constants live in `shared/src/types.ts`.
- The visual bar for the scene is `docs/LOOT_DROP_VISUAL_PRD.md`; check
  changes against `docs/PLAYTEST_VISUAL_CHECKLIST.md`.
